  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Features</h3>\n<p>Adds extra information to tasks.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shows key(s) required for the task if applicable.</li>\n<li>If the task is required for collector.</li>\n<li>If the task is required for lightkeeper.</li>\n<li>Shows the next quest(s) in the chain</li>\n<li>Gunsmith tasks list all required parts and what trader(s) sell those parts</li>\n<li>If applicable shows the time gate until next gunsmith task unlocks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/6062-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" alt=\"6062-pasted-from-clipboard-png\" /></h3>\n<h3>Usage</h3>\n<p>Just install it!</p>\n<h3>Additional Details</h3>\n<p>If you find any issues, open a Github issue <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/robpneu/SPT-Expanded-Task-Text/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a> and I’ll see what I can do.</p>\n<p>This is a re-release with permission of the original author, Dirtbikercj</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Extract zip and drop user folder inside of your SPTarkov folder</p>\n<p>Demonstration Video (this is for SAIN, but the same concept applies to all of my mods). Credit to Drakia for the video</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Original Mod by Dirtbikercj. Re-posted with permission.</p>\n<p>Please show him lots of love. I’ve agreed to handle maintenance going forward but he’s the real creator. He’s given a lot to this community and deserves all the credit and praise, and none of the grief that’s been shown him in the past. I hope he makes his way back to modding but I wish him the best regardless.</p></div></div></div>\n",
